    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7615" root="حرز" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرُزَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرُزَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَازَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِرْزٌ</span>,
(TA,) <i>It</i> (a place, TA) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, fortified,
strong,</i> or <i>protected against attack.</i> (K, TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِزَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَزَ</span></b> , <i>He was very pious,</i> or <i>abstinent
from unlawful things.</i> (Sgh, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرَزَهُ</span>: see 4,
in three places.

